  "description": "Stops Umbraco sites being OOM-killed in memory-limited containers while browsing the media section. Caps the unmanaged buffer pool ImageSharp retains and bounds how many images are processed concurrently, both derived from the memory available to the process. Backport of the fix proposed for the CMS in umbraco/Umbraco-CMS#23557, for Umbraco 13, 17 and 18 sites that need it now.",
